OL,3,GNEWSA'Van loads' of alcohol seized     
OL,4,Aduring raid                            
OL,6,FPolice say tens of thousands of pounds'
OL,7,Fworth of alcohol was seized during     
OL,8,Fenforcement action in Leicester on     
OL,9,FWednesday.                             
OL,11,FAuthorities, including Leicestershire  
OL,12,FPolice and Leicestershire Fire and     
OL,13,FRescue Service, took part in a joint   
OL,14,Foperation in Narborough Road.          
OL,16,FThe force said nine arrests were also  
OL,17,Fmade in relation to drug, immigration  
OL,18,Fand licensing offences.                
